---

Every password used anywhere in this project (pwdemo/synthetic_data.py)
is synthetic — invented for this demonstration, never sourced from a
real breach dataset. This project is an educational tool for
understanding password hashing; it is not a general-purpose password
cracking tool and provides no interface for testing arbitrary real
passwords or hashes.
